-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Oct  1 06:29:57 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package 0.8.5:
  * Agent runtime with upstream default features: agent-runtime,
    default-channels (acp-server, webhook, email, telegram,
    discord, filesystem), acp-bridge, gateway,
    observability-prometheus and schema-export
  * Ships the zerocode TUI and the web dashboard under
    /usr/share/zeroclawlabs/web/dist (embedded-web stays off,
    the dashboard is data files, not linked code)
  * Web tree builds offline from the vendored node_modules
    (npm ci via zeroclaw-use-npm-ci-for-web-build.patch)
  * Link native aarch64 builds with the default cc: upstream's
    .cargo/config.toml pins Debian-style aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc,
    which does not exist on openSUSE
  * Keep debug symbols (upstream sets strip = true and release
    defaults to no debug info) so the debuginfo packages are not
    empty; cap build parallelism with %limit_build and request
    32 G workers via _constraints for the fat-LTO link
  * ExclusiveArch 64-bit Rust tier-1 arches only
  * License (MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND MPL-2.0: only copyleft
    linked is option-ext MPL-2.0; web bundle path is
    MIT/ISC/BSD-3-Clause only, see Legal-Review-Notice

